{"id":"lourd","lemma":"lourd","pos":"adj","rank":1677,"glosses":["heavy","loaded with","clumsy, oafish"],"ipa":"/luʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d1/Fr-lourd.ogg/Fr-lourd.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"lourde","masculinePlural":"lourds","femininePlural":"lourdes"},"formAudio":{"lourde":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-lourde.wav","lourds":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-lourds.wav","lourdes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-lourdes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mon sac est très lourd.","en":"My bag is very heavy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/268404","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"bag, sack"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Quel est le plus lourd des deux ?","en":"Which is the heavier of the two?","words":[{"g":"which"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"more / no longer"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"two"}]},{"text":"Ces livres sont lourds.","en":"These books are heavy.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"book","l":"livre"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Ça semble un peu lourd.","en":"It looks a little heavy.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to seem","l":"sembler"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"a little, a bit"]]},{"text":"Les haltères sont lourds.","en":"The barbells are heavy.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"dumbbell, barbell","l":"haltère"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]}]}